WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.309
After a few days, the lazy holidays were turning into a nightmare.

2
00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:12.054
Since the girls were not allowed to do their chores—as part of the experiment —the house soon began to look and smell like a dumpster.

3
00:00:12.055 --> 00:00:20.117
The only tidy, well-kept part of the home was Mother's bedroom and her spot in the living room where she had her chair and reading table.

4
00:00:20.118 --> 00:00:26.148
She sat there now, pretending to be interested in a book, but actually observing her girls.

5
00:00:26.149 --> 00:00:32.265
Meg, Mother noticed, looked cross and agitated, traits her eldest daughter normally did not display.

6
00:00:32.266 --> 00:00:39.133
Her hair was carelessly tied up and her clothes had several stains, even a small hole under the armpit.

7
00:00:39.134 --> 00:00:45.002
Jo looked like a volcano ready to erupt as she stomped around, shouting loudly at no one in particular,

8
00:00:45.003 --> 00:00:48.980
"Whoever took my book had better hand it over at once!"

9
00:00:48.981 --> 00:00:54.244
Beth, the mildest and gentlest of the four, could be mistaken for a starved child

10
00:00:54.245 --> 00:01:00.406
because she was spending all her time playing the piano and forgetting a fundamental part of her well-being: eating.

11
00:01:00.407 --> 00:01:07.166
Glancing at Beth's fingers, it was just as Mother suspected: they were swollen, stiff, and raw.

12
00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:11.545
Of the four girls, however, Amy was clearly the messiest.

13
00:01:11.546 --> 00:01:18.265
Her paints and brushes were scattered everywhere, making it a challenge at times to walk without tripping over her art tools.

14
00:01:18.266 --> 00:01:24.040
Her usually curly bouncy hair was now oily and sticking to her cheeks like uncooked bacon.

15
00:01:24.041 --> 00:01:30.748
Specks of paint decorated her hair as if someone had stood over her and sprinkled it generously onto her head.

16
00:01:30.749 --> 00:01:37.697
"Thank goodness, tomorrow is the last day of this experiment," Mother said to herself.

17
00:01:37.698 --> 00:01:43.065
The next morning the girls reluctantly went downstairs expecting cold food at the table.

18
00:01:43.066 --> 00:01:48.781
During the week of the experiment, by the time the girls had got up, their breakfast was already cold.

19
00:01:48.782 --> 00:01:55.253
They were grumbling and complaining until Jo, who was leading the pack, stopped, sniffed, and smiled.

20
00:01:55.254 --> 00:01:58.497
"Girls! Can you smell that?" she asked.

21
00:01:58.498 --> 00:02:04.115
"Mmm . . . smells like sausages!" said Amy, breathing in deeply.

22
00:02:04.116 --> 00:02:12.610
Like a pack of famished wolves, the girls tore into the dining room, where they were greeted by Mother, who was just laying out a plate of sausages.

23
00:02:12.611 --> 00:02:19.935
"Good morning, my little daughters. Since the experiment ends today, I thought we'd celebrate with a late breakfast."

24
00:02:19.936 --> 00:02:25.813
Gratefully, the girls sat down to devour their meal while Mother asked their opinions about the experiment.

25
00:02:25.814 --> 00:02:29.870
"It was fun for one day," Jo said in-between bites.

26
00:02:29.871 --> 00:02:34.729
"But I got so bored! I actually wanted to clean up my room after a while."

27
00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:40.453
Meg nodded and said, "I had such an ache to pick up a needle and mend some old clothes."

28
00:02:40.455 --> 00:02:44.657
"Well, I didn't realize how messy I was," cried Amy.

29
00:02:44.658 --> 00:02:48.528
"My hair, my clothes . . . I looked frightening!"

30
00:02:48.529 --> 00:02:57.870
"I found that when I played the piano, I forgot about everything else," said Beth, blushing. "Sometimes I even forgot to eat."

31
00:02:57.871 --> 00:03:05.670
"How lucky that we have you, Mother," said Amy dramatically. "Without you, we might have died!"

32
00:03:05.671 --> 00:03:12.406
Mother was thoughtful for a moment before replying, "Well, actually I'm taking the day off tomorrow."

33
00:03:12.407 --> 00:03:14.777
The girls stared at her, stunned.

34
00:03:14.778 --> 00:03:17.148
"What do you mean?" asked Meg.

35
00:03:17.149 --> 00:03:24.683
"Since you girls had one week to do as you please, I think I deserve one day all to myself," said Mother.

36
00:03:24.684 --> 00:03:32.434
The girls looked at each other, at a loss for words, until Jo finally said, "Of course, Mother should have the day off.

37
00:03:32.435 --> 00:03:35.504
Don't worry, Mother, we'll manage fine on our own."

38
00:03:35.505 --> 00:03:42.439
"Thank you, darling," said Mother with a smile, then added, "and by the way, Hannah is taking the day off too."

39
00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:49.077
With that Mother got up and left her daughters contemplating how to deal with the situation.

40
00:03:49.078 --> 00:03:52.042
That day was a busy one for the March sisters.

41
00:03:52.043 --> 00:03:58.526
After they happily and eagerly performed their chores, they discussed how to divide Mother and Hannah's workload between them.

42
00:03:58.527 --> 00:04:02.993
"Since Jo and I get up early, we'll make breakfast," said Meg.

43
00:04:02.994 --> 00:04:08.074
"I can go to the grocer's to buy our fruit and vegetables," offered Beth.

44
00:04:08.075 --> 00:04:12.119
"I'll do the wash and hang it outside to dry," said Amy.

45
00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:16.616
"What else does Mother do?" Jo asked, tapping the pencil on her lips.

46
00:04:16.617 --> 00:04:20.045
"Who's going to make lunch and dinner?" Amy asked.

47
00:04:20.046 --> 00:04:25.140
"Amy and I can make lunch if Jo and Beth take care of dinner," suggested Meg.

48
00:04:25.141 --> 00:04:36.988
With everyone happy, Jo sat back with her hands folded behind her head and said in a relaxed, confident way, "Mother has nothing to worry about."

49
00:04:36.989 --> 00:04:44.398
It was strange not to see Mother or Hannah in the kitchen the next morning, but Meg and Jo quickly got busy making breakfast.

50
00:04:44.399 --> 00:04:50.881
They decided on ham and eggs with fresh bread, since Mother always baked her breads early in the morning.

51
00:04:50.882 --> 00:04:56.912
"Jo!" Meg cried, looking around, "we forgot to set the dough out last night for the bread!"

52
00:04:56.913 --> 00:05:04.940
The girls had often watched Mother kneading the dough and setting it out to rise the night before so that she could bake it first thing in the morning.

53
00:05:04.941 --> 00:05:13.924
Enjoying a slice of warm fresh bread might not seem like much, but it brought great pleasure and comfort to the girls at the start of the day.

54
00:05:13.925 --> 00:05:18.784
Today, sadly, they would have to do without that morning ritual.

55
00:05:18.785 --> 00:05:22.935
"Where are the eggs?" Jo asked, looking in the baskets and the pantry.

56
00:05:22.936 --> 00:05:27.611
"Something's burning on the stove!" Meg pointed to the smoke coming from a pan.

57
00:05:27.612 --> 00:05:35.725
"Oh, the ham!" exclaimed Jo. Forgetting how hot the pan was, she grabbed the scorching handle then dropped the pan and its contents

58
00:05:35.726 --> 00:05:39.367
(four thick pieces of burnt ham) onto the floor.

59
00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:44.329
The girls ended up having fruit and milk for breakfast.

60
00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:52.870
Just before setting out for the grocer's, Beth realized she didn't know what to buy, so she went to Mother, who was sitting in her chair reading.

61
00:05:52.871 --> 00:05:59.027
"Darling," Mother interrupted, holding up her hand when Beth started speaking, "today is my day off.

62
00:05:59.028 --> 00:06:01.351
You must figure it out on your own."

63
00:06:01.352 --> 00:06:06.649
A little while later, Amy also approached Mother for advice on what she should wash first.

64
00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:12.081
Mother simply repeated what she had told Beth and returned to her book.

65
00:06:12.082 --> 00:06:16.181
The girls did not realize how dependent they were on Mother and Hannah.

66
00:06:16.182 --> 00:06:22.608
Sitting together for their dinner—a simple meal of meatloaf and bread—the girls talked about their day.

67
00:06:22.609 --> 00:06:29.540
"I didn't realize how much Mother and Hannah did for us," said Meg, resting her weary head on her hands.

68
00:06:29.541 --> 00:06:34.284
"My hands are still hurting from doing the laundry," complained Amy.

69
00:06:34.285 --> 00:06:38.041
"It was so hard to choose what to buy," said Beth.

70
00:06:38.042 --> 00:06:42.616
"I wonder if Mother plans to take days off regularly," said Amy.

71
00:06:42.617 --> 00:06:46.532
"I think Mother wanted to teach us a lesson," said Jo.

72
00:06:46.533 --> 00:06:51.522
Nodding, Meg agreed. "Our experiment taught us to appreciate work."

73
00:06:51.523 --> 00:06:56.804
"And Mother wanted us to see the importance of taking care of ourselves," added Jo.

74
00:06:56.805 --> 00:06:59.611
"And of helping each other," said Beth.

75
00:06:59.612 --> 00:07:05.603
"And supporting each other," said Meg as she tried to swallow a bite of dry salty meatloaf.

76
00:07:05.604 --> 00:07:12.565
"And loving each other," smiled Amy, pushing her plate away.

